{
 "_doc": "ZenRay Meshes car pipeline (28 October 2026). Stages run in order by Scripts/ZenRayMeshesCar.py. Append each validated component stage before 'sheet'. The car in progress is work/car/delivery_pipe.npz. 28 October 2026 : the curve rig, its fair cage and the smooth curve verifier run before the sheet.",
 "stages": [
  {
